      "writtenOn": "2026-07-10T15:16:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e For all the /meta fetch all the history\n\nIsn\u0027t this a bit overkill? Or maybe we should make it configurable?\nApply-object was always meant to be a quick shortcut to getting replication done. Sure, we\u0027ve found an issue with rebase strategies where really you\u0027d need the last 2 elements in the meta ref, but sending the whole meta ref seems excessive?\n\nWhat if we have thousands of updates?",
